random_value ports the MT19937 state transition and output transformation
carried by that bundle. Its original implementation is credited to:
Copyright (C) 1997 - 2002, Makoto Matsumoto and Takuji Nishimura,
All rights reserved.
The bundle also credits Sean McCullough for its JavaScript namespace wrapper.
The complete BSD three-clause notice for the MT19937 portions is in
../vendor/MT19937-LICENSE.txt.

This implementation additionally integrates Cell-Arena-specific constraints.
The original notices are retained, supplied alongside source and binary,
and embedded in both distributed HTML entry points. This sidecar supplements
the C source and compiled binary; it is not a claim of upstream
authorship or endorsement of Cell-Arena's extensions.
